\v 3 But¦105742 maybe you're¦105731 thinking that¦105733 you can judge¦105737 others doing¦105743 these things and¦105742 yet \add somehow\add* escape¦105747 \nd God's¦105751\nd* judgement¦105749 when you do them¦105744 yourself¦105744?
\v 4 Or¦105752 maybe you're¦105764 \add taking advantage\add* of¦105753 \nd God's¦105770\nd* kindness and¦105758 patience¦105763, without realising that¦105766 his¦105757 kindness was \add meant\add* to lead¦105774 you to \add ≈turn¦105772 away from your wrongdoing\add*?
