\v 19 We¦106405 know¦106405 that whatever the law says¦106412, it's¦106417 for \add everyone\add* that the law applies to¦106413, so that no one can speak¦106417 against it, and¦106422 the whole¦106425 world¦106427 will be¦106421 bound by \nd God's¦106429\nd* judgement¦106423.
