\p
\v 21 But¦106456 now¦106445 \nd God¦106450\nd* has¦106451 revealed¦106451 a way to remove guilt that's not by¦106453 rules—a way that Mosheh and¦106456 the¦106457 prophets¦106458 wrote \nd about¦106450\nd*.
