\v 25 who God placed \add on the altar\add* as¦106506 a sacrifice for¦106515 sin¦106525. \add This happens\add* through¦106507 faith¦106509 in¦106510 his blood¦106514, which was a sign¦106516 of¦106513 his sinlessness.
