\v 26 because of his patience, waiting for¦106531 the¦106538 present¦106539 time¦106540 to show his righteousness¦106535 and to be¦106543 fair, and to remove the guilt of those with faith¦106550 in¦106526 \nd Yeshua¦106551\nd*.)
